                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a479cef6-08bb-3f89-bf87-5b92f4b2cee4",
                        "entry_id": "03191289-14a5-349b-9169-d2b6314ded58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "das Miteinbeziehen von Umgebungsluft durch Verwirbelungseffekte im Randbereich von Konvektionswolken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37eaeab4-face-41a3-8b9a-380b795c6034",
                                "sense_id": "a479cef6-08bb-3f89-bf87-5b92f4b2cee4",
                                "text": "Die Vertikalprofile der spezifischen Wolkeneigenschaften zeigen den Einfluß des Entrainments für die verschiedenen Wolkenradien eines Cumulus-Ensembles."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc5a39e6-3ffc-3d64-a922-e9de948bb86c",
                        "entry_id": "03191289-14a5-349b-9169-d2b6314ded58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mitreißen von Tröpfchen durch den Gasstrom"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Verfahrenstechnik"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "658e2438-68fa-4e6e-b413-a7ac8a9dde77",
                                "sense_id": "bc5a39e6-3ffc-3d64-a922-e9de948bb86c",
                                "text": "Dieses Entrainment ist grundsätzlich unerwünscht, da es den angestrebten Gegenstrom von Gas und Flüssigkeit stört und damit die Trennwirkung erniedrigt."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b93fad80-b935-3889-9421-a7f32769af93",
                        "entry_id": "03191289-14a5-349b-9169-d2b6314ded58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synchronisation, Kopplung von endogenen Biorhythmen an Zeitgeberschwingungen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1c70e69-6305-4114-8267-3a9369f1e64e",
                                "sense_id": "b93fad80-b935-3889-9421-a7f32769af93",
                                "text": "Diese Synchronisation (Entrainment) ist deshalb von so grundsätzlicher Bedeutung für das Gesamtphänomen, weil darin der Einfluß der täglichen Schwankungen von Licht und Dunkel auf den Ablauf der circadianen Uhr sichtbar wird."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa8e2391-518f-47a2-82bc-1e22e753ecdc",
                        "source_entry_id": "03191289-14a5-349b-9169-d2b6314ded58",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a0f703c-4ef3-31a9-a940-87b72eb1d377",
                        "source_sense_description": "eine Bewegung zu einem Achsmittelpunkt",
                        "target_lang_word": "entrainment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "entrainment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                        "entry_id": "e8890030-94d6-318c-8bf2-773f2ca0a738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Enthusiasm, liveliness; impulsiveness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e4a6a23-0b33-46ad-be3b-3a426dd392de",
                                                "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                                "text": "Carlo Antonio Bertinazzi, he whom the French stage knows under the name of Carlin, was the gayest of all comedians; he knew a thousand ways of amusing his audience, and would make them die with pleasure and laughter by his affecting performance of the Vingt-six infortunes d’ Arlequin; the entrainment of his gaiety and bonhomie were everywhere extolled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9584d24-6cae-4409-a2ed-bb226df6c3c2",
                                                "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                                "text": "A philosopher, through indolence and carelessness before the Revolution, superstitious afterwards, through weakness and entrainment [translating entraînement], he threatened the Revolution with his sword from a distance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3c26348-1ba5-457d-b7b9-3d0d65f94259",
                                                "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                                "text": "At page 60, and elsewhere, the English general is only spoken of as a mere nobody, carried away resistlessly by the “entrainments” [translating entraînements] around him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a8bc60a-07e1-419e-b599-d8c77fef74af",
                                                "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                                "text": "The reviewer had to recognize [Thomas Babington] Macaulay’s talents; the entrainment of his picturesque, vivid, and pregnant execution could not be escaped."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42f2e9aa-312b-400b-9f72-831d316c55dc",
                                                "sense_id": "c25b0a35-6b14-31ad-bc1f-b745b8b10431",
                                                "text": "For Longinus, it is the rhetor’s public capacity to bring out the whole audience’s entrainment to sublimity that is most important."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b7247ea-ed37-3694-b963-9e37c1db05b5",
                                        "entry_id": "e8890030-94d6-318c-8bf2-773f2ca0a738",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several processes in which a solid or liquid is put into motion by a fluid.",
                                            "The carrying away of droplets of liquid during violent boiling."
                                        ],
